WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.100 --> 00:00:06.290
This is Elite Smile,
the dental clinic in Eindhoven,

2
00:00:06.340 --> 00:00:09.040
with a dental hygiene practice in Hoogland.

3
00:00:09.090 --> 00:00:11.530
For Elite Smile we made three things:

4
00:00:11.580 --> 00:00:17.090
a patient app of their own,
a screen where the clinic moves live in 3D,

5
00:00:17.140 --> 00:00:18.460
and a new website.

6
00:00:18.510 --> 00:00:19.770
All in seven languages.

7
00:00:21.220 --> 00:00:22.810
We open the app as Layla.

8
00:00:22.860 --> 00:00:25.410
She got an implant two days ago.

9
00:00:25.460 --> 00:00:27.660
The app knows what she needs to do today:

10
00:00:27.710 --> 00:00:29.960
pain relief, rinsing and her diary.

11
00:00:30.010 --> 00:00:33.960
Her next appointment is all set,
with tailored preparation.

12
00:00:35.410 --> 00:00:37.850
Booking an appointment takes six questions:

13
00:00:37.900 --> 00:00:40.470
for whom, what, where, with whom and when.

14
00:00:40.520 --> 00:00:44.920
The free check-up comes first,
just like on the Elite Smile website.

15
00:00:44.970 --> 00:00:48.790
Once confirmed, the button turns
into the time and the room.

16
00:00:50.240 --> 00:00:53.890
Before the treatment, Layla fills in
her health questionnaire,

17
00:00:53.940 --> 00:00:59.390
sees her implant step by step in 3D,
and signs her consent with her finger.

18
00:00:59.440 --> 00:01:00.710
Is she nervous?

19
00:01:00.760 --> 00:01:04.350
Then she breathes along with the ring,
and the dentist knows in advance.

20
00:01:05.800 --> 00:01:08.080
At the door, she checks in with a slider.

21
00:01:08.130 --> 00:01:10.120
In the chair, she has a pause button:

22
00:01:10.170 --> 00:01:12.110
the room lights up for the dentist.

23
00:01:12.160 --> 00:01:15.960
And those who don't speak Dutch
can show phrases in their own language,

24
00:01:16.010 --> 00:01:18.700
with the Dutch flipped to face the dentist.

25
00:01:20.150 --> 00:01:24.120
Then the aftercare, hour by hour,
or as a conversation to listen to.

26
00:01:24.170 --> 00:01:28.140
A pain diary that tells you when to call,
a medication alarm,

27
00:01:28.190 --> 00:01:30.800
a photo of the wound for the dentist to check,

28
00:01:30.850 --> 00:01:34.170
and an emergency guide that first asks
what can't wait.

29
00:01:35.620 --> 00:01:40.540
In My teeth, every tooth is shown in 3D,
with the X-ray and the implant passport.

30
00:01:40.590 --> 00:01:44.300
The Smile studio shows
how lighter teeth would look.

31
00:01:44.350 --> 00:01:45.400
And for the family:

32
00:01:45.450 --> 00:01:50.430
a brushing coach with prizes, a Braces Buddy
for Sofia and a Kids' Corner for Adam.

33
00:01:51.880 --> 00:01:53.280
Then the clinic screen.

34
00:01:53.330 --> 00:01:55.050
Here is the clinic in 3D:

35
00:01:55.100 --> 00:01:57.960
six treatment rooms, the waiting room
and the front desk.

36
00:01:58.010 --> 00:02:02.380
The six dentists are there, each with
their own face, like in The Sims,

37
00:02:02.430 --> 00:02:05.160
with a diamond that shows how busy they are.

38
00:02:05.210 --> 00:02:06.430
Tap a dentist:

39
00:02:06.480 --> 00:02:11.290
the schedule, how full the day is,
the details, and their own page to share.

40
00:02:11.340 --> 00:02:14.770
Everything Layla does in the app
shows up here instantly.

41
00:02:16.220 --> 00:02:18.440
The website has been redesigned,

42
00:02:18.490 --> 00:02:23.190
with one idea from each of the ten
most-awarded websites of 2026,

43
00:02:23.240 --> 00:02:25.960
and a dedicated page for every dentist.

44
00:02:27.410 --> 00:02:32.010
Everything works in seven languages,
including Arabic, from right to left.

45
00:02:32.060 --> 00:02:37.900
The practices, treatments and dentists
are real; the patients and the schedule are

46
00:02:37.950 --> 00:02:38.220
fictional.

47
00:02:38.270 --> 00:02:39.010
Elite Smile:

48
00:02:39.060 --> 00:02:41.170
your perfect smile starts here.
